{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46657","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见苔色 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见苔色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见苔色，凝然阵未枯。\n浅深围柱础，诘曲遶廊庑。\n碧翠文相间，青黄势自铺。\n爲钱虚玷染，毕竟不如无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}